"""Coordinator resource dashboard (no CDN dependencies)."""
PAGE = r'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>PASADHI Coordinator</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#09141b;color:#edf7f3;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:28px}header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}h1{font-size:28px}a{color:#68dfbc}button{background:#68dfbc;color:#08141a;padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer}.muted{color:#9ab6bd;line-height:1.6}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin:24px 0}.card,.panel{background:#11252e;border:1px solid #284550;border-radius:14px;padding:18px}.card small{color:#9ab6bd}.card strong{display:block;font-size:28px;margin:12px 0}.bar{height:8px;background:#263c46;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;background:#68dfbc;height:100%}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #284550}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.scroll{overflow:auto}.bad{color:#ffba83}.ok{color:#68dfbc}.notice{padding:14px;border-left:3px solid #68dfbc;background:#10232b}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:13px}details{margin-top:22px}#message{min-height:26px}@media(max-width:800px){.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}main{padding:18px}}@media(max-width:440px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
<main><header><h1>PASADHI · Coordinator</h1><a href="/">This machine</a><button id="refresh">Refresh</button></header>
<p class="muted">ภาพรวมทรัพยากร / Cluster resource overview · <span id="url"></span></p><div id="message" role="status">Connecting to coordinator…</div><p id="nodes" class="muted"></p><p id="discovery" class="notice" role="status"></p>
<div id="cards" class="cards"></div><p class="notice">Used = activity measured on reporting hosts, including other apps. Shared = configured contribution limits; it is not a reservation or free capacity. Unavailable and offline telemetry is excluded, never replaced with zero.</p>
<section class="panel"><h2>Nodes</h2><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Node / address</th><th>Role / status</th><th>CPU used / total</th><th>RAM used / total</th><th>Disk used / total</th><th>Sample age</th></tr></thead><tbody id="rows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<p class="muted" id="scope"></p><details><summary>Connect workers and use a stable DNS name / ตั้งค่าเครือข่าย</summary><p>Run the updated PASADHI on every computer and open its LAN launcher (or add --lan). Nodes announce and discover each other automatically; every dashboard can show all discovered nodes. Manual worker URLs remain optional.</p><pre>PASADHI_WORKERS=http://worker-1.lan:8765,http://worker-2.lan:8765
PASADHI_PUBLIC_URL=http://pasadhi-coordinator.lan:8765
PASADHI_HOST=0.0.0.0</pre><p>Set these in the project's .env or process environment, then restart. Each worker must run a version exposing /api/node/resources and accept connections on its LAN interface. Router DNS must resolve these names; setting a URL does not create a DNS record. .local names work only where mDNS is configured.</p><p>Nodes with LAN access disabled still appear as discovered, but their telemetry cannot be collected until restarted with --lan. Discovery needs multicast UDP 5353 on the same LAN and the app TCP port. Older builds without discovery do not announce themselves. Wi-Fi client isolation and VLAN boundaries may prevent discovery; manual URLs remain a fallback. Monitoring does not schedule distributed jobs.</p><p>Use a trusted LAN or an authenticated reverse proxy for remote access. This dashboard follows the application's existing network binding.</p></details></main>
<script>
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),fmt=(v,u='')=>v==null?'Unavailable':Number(v).toLocaleString(undefined,{maximumFractionDigits:2})+u;
$('url').textContent=location.origin+'/dashboard';let busy=false;
function cell(row,text){const td=document.createElement('td');td.textContent=text;row.append(td);return td}
async function refresh(){if(busy)return;busy=true;$('refresh').disabled=true;$('message').textContent='Collecting node telemetry…';try{const response=await fetch('/api/cluster/resources',{cache:'no-store'});const d=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(d.error||'Telemetry unavailable');$('nodes').textContent=`${d.online_nodes} reporting · ${d.offline_nodes} offline · ${d.lan_disabled_nodes||0} LAN off · ${d.configured_nodes} known endpoints · Auto refresh every 15 seconds`;const discovery=d.discovery||{};$('discovery').textContent=(discovery.enabled?'LAN discovery: '+discovery.message+' · '+(d.discovered_nodes||0)+' other PASADHI nodes found.':'LAN discovery is disabled.')+(discovery.enabled&&!discovery.lan_enabled?' This node is localhost-only. Restart with --lan to share its resources.':'');$('cards').replaceChildren();for(const [key,label,unit] of [['cpu_cores','CPU',' cores'],['ram_gib','RAM',' GiB'],['disk_gib','Disk',' GiB'],['gpu_vram_gib','GPU VRAM',' GiB']]){const cap=d.totals.capacity[key],used=d.totals.usage[key],off=d.totals.offered[key];const card=document.createElement('section');card.className='card';const title=document.createElement('small');title.textContent=label+' · host usage';const value=document.createElement('strong');value.textContent=fmt(used.value,unit);const detail=document.createElement('p');detail.className='muted';detail.textContent=`Total ${fmt(cap.value,unit)} · Shared ${fmt(off.value,unit)}`;const coverage=document.createElement('small');coverage.textContent=`Usage reported by ${used.reported_nodes}/${used.total_nodes} nodes`;const bar=document.createElement('div');bar.className='bar';const fill=document.createElement('i');fill.style.width=(used.value==null||!cap.value?0:Math.min(100,used.value/cap.value*100))+'%';bar.append(fill);card.append(title,value,detail,bar,coverage);$('cards').append(card)}$('rows').replaceChildren();for(const report of d.nodes){const tr=document.createElement('tr'),n=report.node;if(report.status!=='online'){cell(tr,report.url);cell(tr,report.status+' — '+(report.error||'same node already counted'));for(let i=0;i<4;i++)cell(tr,'—')}else{const address=cell(tr,n.hostname+' · ');const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=(report.url==='local'?location.origin:report.url)+'/dashboard';link.textContent=report.url;link.target='_blank';link.rel='noopener';address.append(link);cell(tr,n.role+' / online');for(const k of ['cpu_cores','ram_gib','disk_gib'])cell(tr,fmt(n.usage[k])+' / '+fmt(n.capacity[k]));cell(tr,fmt(Math.max(0,Date.now()/1000-n.sampled_at),' s ago'))}$('rows').append(tr)}$('scope').textContent=d.scope;$('message').textContent='Updated '+new Date(d.sampled_at*1000).toLocaleTimeString();$('message').className='ok'}catch(error){$('message').textContent='Refresh failed: '+error.message+'. Last rendered values may be stale.';$('message').className='bad'}finally{busy=false;$('refresh').disabled=false}}
$('refresh').onclick=refresh;refresh();setInterval(refresh,15000);
</script></html>'''
